<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<%- include('partials/head', { title: 'Evo Meals — School Meal Management Platform, Kuwait' }) %>
<meta name="description" content="Evo Meals is the digital school meal management platform connecting schools, parents, students, and catering partners in Kuwait through subscriptions, ordering, tap-to-collect, and real-time reporting.">
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Organization",
  "name": "Evo Meals",
  "url": "/",
  "description": "Digital school meal management platform connecting schools, parents, students, and catering partners in Kuwait through subscriptions, ordering, tap-to-collect, and real-time reporting.",
  "areaServed": {
    "@type": "Country",
    "name": "Kuwait"
  },
  "email": "hello@evomeals.demo"
}
</script>
</head>
<body>

<%- include('partials/sitenav', { active: 'home' }) %>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap-wide hero-inner">
    <div class="hero-copy" data-reveal>
      <span class="eyebrow on-dark">The school meal management platform</span>
      <h1>Smarter school meals.<br>Happier parents.<br><em>Better schools.</em></h1>
      <p class="lede">Evo Meals is a complete digital platform for managing school meal programs — menu planning, subscriptions, ordering, tap-to-collect delivery, parent notifications, and real-time reporting, all in one system connecting schools, parents, students, and catering partners.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions hero-actions-3">
        <a href="/schools" class="btn btn-primary">For Schools</a>
        <a href="/register" class="btn btn-outline-lime">Order Meals</a>
        <a href="/#app" class="btn btn-ghost">Download App</a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-proof">
        <span class="proof-label">Live at</span>
        <div class="schools">
          <span>American Creativity Academy</span>
          <span>Kuwait English School</span>
          <span>The English School</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-visual" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="ecosystem" data-reveal>
        <div class="eco-node">
          <span class="eco-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="7" y="2" width="10" height="20" rx="2"/><path d="M11 18h2"/></svg></span>
          <span class="eco-label">Parent App</span>
        </div>
        <div class="eco-line"></div>
        <div class="eco-node eco-hub">
          <span class="eco-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M6 8.5a8 8 0 0 1 12 0M8.5 11a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 7 0M12 14v.01"/></svg></span>
          <span class="eco-label">Evo Platform</span>
        </div>
        <div class="eco-line"></div>
        <div class="eco-node">
          <span class="eco-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 21V9l8-5 8 5v12M9 21v-6h6v6M4 21h16"/></svg></span>
          <span class="eco-label">School</span>
        </div>
        <div class="eco-line"></div>
        <div class="eco-node">
          <span class="eco-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 12h16M6 12V7a6 6 0 0 1 12 0v5M5 12l1.5 8h11L19 12"/></svg></span>
          <span class="eco-label">Kitchen</span>
        </div>
        <div class="eco-line"></div>
        <div class="eco-node">
          <span class="eco-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="3.5"/><path d="M5 21a7 7 0 0 1 14 0"/></svg></span>
          <span class="eco-label">Student</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="ecosystem-caption">One order flows from a parent's phone to the kitchen and back to a confirmed, collected meal — every step visible to the people who need to see it.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Trust bar: PLACEHOLDER TREATMENT — do not fill these with invented
     numbers. Real figures (schools served, students, meals delivered,
     technology uptime/metrics) need to come from the client before this
     goes live. Visually distinct (dashed, muted) so it reads as pending,
     not as a real understated stat. -->
<section class="trustbar">
  <div class="wrap trustbar-grid">
    <div class="trustbar-item">
      <span class="trustbar-label">Schools</span>
      <span class="trustbar-value trustbar-pending">Figures added at launch</span>
    </div>
    <div class="trustbar-item">
      <span class="trustbar-label">Students</span>
      <span class="trustbar-value trustbar-pending">Figures added at launch</span>
    </div>
    <div class="trustbar-item">
      <span class="trustbar-label">Meals</span>
      <span class="trustbar-value trustbar-pending">Figures added at launch</span>
    </div>
    <div class="trustbar-item">
      <span class="trustbar-label">Technology</span>
      <span class="trustbar-value">Built on real-time tap infrastructure</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="what-is">
  <div class="wrap what-is-wrap">
    <div data-reveal>
      <span class="eyebrow">What is Evo Meals?</span>
      <h2>Not a food ordering app. A school meal management platform.</h2>
      <p>Evo Meals started with a frustration every parent in Kuwait knows — sending a child off with lunch money and just hoping it was enough, hoping they ate, hoping the allergy you'd mentioned a dozen times was remembered. We built the system we wished existed: one platform that plans menus, runs subscriptions, takes orders, confirms delivery by tap, notifies parents the moment it happens, and gives schools the reporting to run the whole program with confidence.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="what-is-pillars">
      <div class="what-is-pillar" data-reveal data-reveal-group="whatis">
        <span class="what-is-num">01</span>
        <strong>Plan</strong>
        <span>Menus, nutrition, and allergen data set once, enforced everywhere.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="what-is-pillar" data-reveal data-reveal-group="whatis">
        <span class="what-is-num">02</span>
        <strong>Run</strong>
        <span>Subscriptions, orders, and payments handled without paper or WhatsApp.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="what-is-pillar" data-reveal data-reveal-group="whatis">
        <span class="what-is-num">03</span>
        <strong>Report</strong>
        <span>Live dashboards for schools, caterers, and administrators — not month-end spreadsheets.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="why-evo-meals">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
      <span class="eyebrow">Why Evo Meals?</span>
      <h2>Six reasons schools and parents choose the platform.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="why-grid">
      <div class="why-card" data-reveal data-reveal-group="why">
        <div class="why-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="3"/><path d="M8 2v4M16 2v4M4 10h16"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Digital First</h3>
        <p>Replaces manual meal management — paper forms, phone calls, spreadsheets — with one integrated digital platform.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="why-card" data-reveal data-reveal-group="why">
        <div class="why-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="7" y="2" width="10" height="20" rx="2"/><path d="M11 18h2"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Parent Friendly</h3>
        <p>A simple ordering and subscription experience parents can actually manage from their phone, in minutes.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="why-card" data-reveal data-reveal-group="why">
        <div class="why-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 3a2.83 2.83 0 0 1 4 4L7 21l-5 1 1-5Z"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Operationally Efficient</h3>
        <p>Connects schools and catering operations directly, so orders, changes, and updates move without a middleman.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="why-card" data-reveal data-reveal-group="why">
        <div class="why-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 12s3.5-7 10-7 10 7 10 7-3.5 7-10 7-10-7-10-7Z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Transparent</h3>
        <p>Menus, prices, and meal information are visible to parents at every step — never hidden behind a phone call.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="why-card" data-reveal data-reveal-group="why">
        <div class="why-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 3v18h18M7 15l4-4 3 3 5-6"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Scalable</h3>
        <p>Built to support multiple schools and growing student populations, not just a single pilot classroom.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="why-card" data-reveal data-reveal-group="why">
        <div class="why-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 19V10M12 19V4M20 19v-7"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Data Driven</h3>
        <p>Turns everyday meal-program activity — orders, collections, subscriptions — into operational insight you can act on.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section on-tint" id="how-it-works">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
      <span class="eyebrow">How the platform works</span>
      <h2>Five roles, one connected system.</h2>
      <p>This is the platform-level view — how a meal moves from a school's program to a specific student's hands. Parents have their own simpler four-step flow below.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="steps steps-5">
      <div class="step" data-reveal data-reveal-group="platformflow">
        <div class="step-num">School</div>
        <h3>Sets up the program</h3>
        <p>Partners with Evo Meals, defines meal plans and pricing, and onboards its parent community.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step" data-reveal data-reveal-group="platformflow">
        <div class="step-num">Parent</div>
        <h3>Subscribes &amp; orders</h3>
        <p>Books a plan for their child, tops up the wallet, and manages everything from one account.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step" data-reveal data-reveal-group="platformflow">
        <div class="step-num">Evo Meals</div>
        <h3>Routes &amp; confirms</h3>
        <p>Matches the order to the right student and allergy profile, and sends it to the kitchen queue.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step" data-reveal data-reveal-group="platformflow">
        <div class="step-num">Caterer</div>
        <h3>Prepares &amp; delivers</h3>
        <p>Sees real orders, not estimates — prepares exactly what's been booked, nothing wasted.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step" data-reveal data-reveal-group="platformflow">
        <div class="step-num">Student</div>
        <h3>Taps &amp; collects</h3>
        <p>One tap at the counter confirms the meal — and their parent sees it happen in real time.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="for-schools-teaser">
  <div class="wrap teaser-wrap">
    <div class="teaser-copy" data-reveal>
      <span class="eyebrow">For Schools</span>
      <h2>Turn your meal program into a digital experience.</h2>
      <p>Replace paper forms and WhatsApp coordination with one platform your administration, your parents, and your caterer all use — and a partnership model built to create value for the school, not just sell it software.</p>
      <a href="/schools" class="btn btn-dark">Explore the School platform</a>
    </div>
    <ul class="teaser-list" data-reveal>
      <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Automated subscriptions, orders &amp; notifications</li>
      <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Higher parent engagement, less admin overhead</li>
      <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Student-level identification — the right meal, every time</li>
      <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> A structured commercial program, not just software</li>
      <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Centralized dashboards, real-time visibility</li>
      <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> A professional experience that replaces manual processes</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section on-tint" id="for-parents">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
      <span class="eyebrow">For Parents</span>
      <h2>Four steps, once a term.</h2>
      <p>Set it up once. From then on, lunch just happens — and you find out about it, instead of wondering.</p>
    </div>

    <ul class="value-checklist" data-reveal>
      <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Convenience</li>
      <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Transparent menus</li>
      <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Easy subscriptions</li>
      <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Digital payments</li>
      <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Notifications</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="parent-flow-grid">
      <div class="steps" style="margin-bottom:0;">
        <div class="step" data-reveal data-reveal-group="parentsteps">
          <div class="step-num">Book</div>
          <h3>Pick a plan</h3>
          <p>Choose a meal, pay-as-you-go or a flat monthly plan, and the total is calculated and shown before you confirm — never a surprise charge.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step" data-reveal data-reveal-group="parentsteps">
          <div class="step-num">Wallet</div>
          <h3>Top up once</h3>
          <p>Fund the wallet with KNET. Bookings draw from balance automatically — no cash, no forgotten lunch money, ever.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step" data-reveal data-reveal-group="parentsteps">
          <div class="step-num">Tap</div>
          <h3>Your child taps in</h3>
          <p>At the meal counter, their card taps the reader. No PIN, no queue for cash — just a two-second tap they can do themselves.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step" data-reveal data-reveal-group="parentsteps">
          <div class="step-num">Notified</div>
          <h3>You see it happen</h3>
          <p>The moment they tap, your dashboard updates: which meal, and the exact time they collected it.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-visual parent-flow-visual" aria-hidden="true" data-reveal>
        <div class="tap-demo">
          <div class="tap-card">
            <div class="chip"></div>
            <div class="card-name">Ahmed A.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tap-reader pulse">
            <div class="ripple"></div>
            <div class="ripple delay"></div>
            <div class="reader-ring">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M6 8.5a8 8 0 0 1 12 0M8.5 11a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 7 0M12 14v.01"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="reader-label">MEAL READER · GATE 2</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tap-toast">
            <div class="toast-icon">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" pathLength="1"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="toast-title">Ahmed tapped in — lunch collected</div>
              <div class="toast-sub">12:14 PM · Arabiatta Chicken Pasta</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="journey-block" data-reveal>
      <span class="journey-label">Your complete parent journey — not just booking</span>
      <ul class="journey-pills">
        <li>View the menu</li>
        <li>Check nutritional info</li>
        <li>Subscribe to a plan</li>
        <li>Select meals</li>
        <li>Pay securely</li>
        <li>Track orders</li>
        <li>Get notifications</li>
        <li class="journey-pill-emphasis">Manage multiple children</li>
        <li class="journey-pill-emphasis">Renew your subscription</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="pricing-grid" style="margin-top:56px;">
      <div class="price-card" data-reveal data-reveal-group="pricing">
        <div class="price-tag">Pay as you go</div>
        <div class="price-amt">KWD <%= (plans.single ? plans.single.rateKWD : 1).toFixed(3) %><span>/day</span></div>
        <p>Book single days whenever you need to — school trips, half terms, or just trying it out.</p>
        <a href="/register" class="btn btn-outline" style="width:100%;">Start booking</a>
      </div>
      <div class="price-card featured" data-reveal data-reveal-group="pricing">
        <span class="badge-save">Most parents choose this</span>
        <div class="price-tag">Monthly plan</div>
        <div class="price-amt">KWD <%= (plans.monthly ? plans.monthly.rateKWD : 24).toFixed(3) %><span>/month</span></div>
        <p><%= plans.monthly ? plans.monthly.monthlyDays : 22 %> school days covered, booked once — works out cheaper than paying daily, and one less thing to remember.</p>
        <a href="/register" class="btn btn-primary" style="width:100%;">Start with the monthly plan</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="for-caterers-teaser">
  <div class="wrap teaser-wrap teaser-wrap-reverse">
    <ul class="teaser-list" data-reveal>
      <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Predictable demand from real digital orders, not estimates</li>
      <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> One digital queue instead of phone calls and paper tickets</li>
      <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Far less manual processing and reconciliation</li>
      <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Access to a ready-made, school-specific customer base</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="teaser-copy" data-reveal>
      <span class="eyebrow">For Caterers</span>
      <h2>Kitchens run better on real orders.</h2>
      <p>Evo Meals gives your kitchen a live, accurate order queue instead of guesswork — you're an operational partner in the platform, not a vendor working off a phone call and a paper list.</p>
      <a href="/caterers" class="btn btn-dark">Explore the Caterer platform</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section on-tint" id="features">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
      <span class="eyebrow">Platform features</span>
      <h2>Real capability, not just a booking form.</h2>
      <p>Everything below is live in the product today — organized by who actually uses it.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-roles">
      <div class="feature-role" data-reveal data-reveal-group="features">
        <h3>Parents</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Order, subscribe &amp; manage in one account</li>
          <li>Real-time collection notifications</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-role" data-reveal data-reveal-group="features">
        <h3>Schools</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Live monitoring dashboards</li>
          <li>Subscription &amp; participation analytics</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-role" data-reveal data-reveal-group="features">
        <h3>Caterers</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Digital order receiving &amp; queue management</li>
